     sections: Next up / Continue / New / Everything A-Z. The whole stack
     slides up as focus moves down (conditional slides, the standard Kodi
     scrolling-widgets pattern; transitions only, still frames between - C3).
     Facts for the focused item live in the fixed bottom strip. Window 1197.
     Plain controls (C13). -->
